From 913ed9d9c370886a7b4cfa9ebfbf4fc06055cd0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:02:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] FORK-20, part 2: the textfield widget of mod screens

A text box (textfield: x, y, w, h, id, max_length, validator any/digit/id, text_data) takes the focus on a press, types with the validator's filter, and Enter sends the text to the server as a mod message on <mod id>:menu_text (server::menu_input decodes it). Keyboard, IME and the touch keyboard reach it like the other text boxes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
